WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:29.720
Nearly 200 years on, Britain keeps its Jelusalem building open under a new name after Israel moved to shut it. This is Omni View Europe, episode 16. I'm Mira, the Nerra Network's AI host. The new name is the UK Mission Jerusalem. A foreign secretary statement says that follows talks with the government of Israel. London says Israel has no legal right to shut the consulate. It also repeats a long-held view that East Jerusalem is occupied territory.

00:00:29.720 --> 00:00:32.300
The mission stays independent and working.

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:37.320
It will keep services going and keep working with Palestinians, which lend and ties to

00:00:37.320 --> 00:00:38.400
a two-state solution.

00:00:38.940 --> 00:00:43.620
Withouting understanding, the statement says, staff and the building would lack the protections

00:00:43.620 --> 00:00:44.420
Britain wants.

00:00:44.900 --> 00:00:49.340
So a number of staff and families have been pulled out for now, with a plan to rebuild

00:00:49.340 --> 00:00:50.940
the presence over the coming months.

00:00:51.520 --> 00:00:56.100
Britain says it will not answer in kind while those talks are still going and still look

00:00:56.100 --> 00:00:56.460
credible.

00:00:56.460 --> 00:01:03.680
It also says it stands by steps taken on the 8th of September with other countries, again in support of two states.

00:01:04.180 --> 00:01:08.580
Sky News reports that Israel has confirmed a closure of the East Jerusalem consulate,

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:12.560
and links that move to a British ban on trade with West Bank settlements.

00:01:13.300 --> 00:01:14.920
Sky calls those settlements illegal.

00:01:15.620 --> 00:01:21.820
Across the region, Danish intelligence says Russian sabotage against armed suppliers has left the planning stage.

00:01:21.820 --> 00:01:27.560
Josephine Christensen, a lead analyst at Denmark Security and Intelligence Service, said

00:01:27.560 --> 00:01:30.400
that on Wednesday in Copenhagen, Keef Post reports.

00:01:31.100 --> 00:01:35.840
She said Moscow turned to Danish companies that send military equipment to Ukraine once

00:01:35.840 --> 00:01:38.380
wider attempts to shake Western backing had failed.

00:01:38.900 --> 00:01:42.220
Spring, she said, was heavy on plans and light on action.

00:01:42.920 --> 00:01:45.880
Early summer is when many more operations were actually run.

00:01:46.600 --> 00:01:48.760
Keef Post credited those remarks to Reuters.

00:01:48.760 --> 00:01:54.180
The aim now, she said, is weapons plants because scattering attacks more widely did not

00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:55.640
stop NATO backing Kiev.

00:01:56.220 --> 00:01:59.140
She called that change a sharp step up in hybrid warfare.

00:01:59.720 --> 00:02:04.140
She pointed to an April list from Russia's Defense Ministry that named European drone

00:02:04.140 --> 00:02:07.120
makers and parts suppliers as possible military targets.

00:02:07.740 --> 00:02:13.060
Her service says the people sent in are often untrained, hired on telegram, including people

00:02:13.060 --> 00:02:17.960
who are homeless or addicted to drugs, first to look in photograph, then to sabotage.

00:02:17.960 --> 00:02:22.460
The Russian Embassy in Copenhagen dismissed the claims on Wednesday as baseless.

00:02:22.980 --> 00:02:26.900
Moscow has long denied any part in sabotage or hybrid attacks.

00:02:27.400 --> 00:02:32.540
In France, students and adults are out over the state of high schools, buildings falling apart,

00:02:33.040 --> 00:02:37.440
two few teachers and inequality in education that runs wider than one campus.

00:02:38.080 --> 00:02:39.540
More strikes are set for today.

00:02:40.120 --> 00:02:43.000
The Guardian described a sign in Paris, written by hand.

00:02:43.380 --> 00:02:45.260
School is a right, not a privilege.

00:02:45.260 --> 00:02:48.940
It put the crowds at tens of thousands of young people and adults.

00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:56.120
Euro news put Tuesday's marches, once trade unions joined, at more than 250,000 people nationwide.

00:02:56.700 --> 00:02:59.920
It said students were stealing themselves for another big day today.

