00:06:01.400 --> 00:06:02.440
Import and processing,

00:06:02.860 --> 00:06:04.440
not planting inside the EU,

00:06:04.920 --> 00:06:05.760
a 10-year term,

00:06:06.160 --> 00:06:08.500
and EU rules on labels and traceability.

00:06:09.020 --> 00:06:10.880
That 10-year clock is now running.

00:06:11.440 --> 00:06:12.340
A sign of progress.

